  "id": "BIT-kyverno-2026-122311",
  "summary": "Kyverno 1.16.0 before 1.19.2 Path Traversal in Namespaced CEL Policies via resource argument",
  "details": "Kyverno from 1.16.0 before 1.19.2 fails to validate path segments in the resource argument of resource.get() and resource.post(), allowing namespaced CEL policies to escape their namespace. Tenants who can create a NamespacedValidatingPolicy can insert .. segments to read and write arbitrary cluster objects using the admission controller's ServiceAccount, leading to cluster takeover.",
